  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Share Price History</b></p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Our Common Stock is listed and traded on the New York Stock Exchange <i>(&#8220;NYSE&#8221;)</i> under the trading symbol &#8220;TRAK&#8221;. The following table sets forth the high and low sales prices of our Common Stock&#160;for the periods indicated:</p>
