  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">Net cash used in investing activities was $4.1 million for fiscal 2026, compared with nominal net cash provided by investing activities in fiscal 2025. The increase in cash used in investing activities was primarily attributable to $3.0 million advanced under the SPAR note receivable and approximately $1.0 million of capitalized software development costs.</p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
