  <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">Current assets totaled $32,752,828&#160;as of June 30, 2026, as compared to $33,685,800&#160;as of June 30, 2025.&#160;The decrease in current assets is primarily attributable to the decrease in cash,&#160;and&#160;prepaid expense and other current assets partially offset by an increase in accounts receivable.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
