<tr class="finHeading" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">liability</em></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><b>Balance &#8211; June 30, 2025</b></p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction id="c151373631" contextRef="i_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">3,175,908</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; margin: 0"> <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Amounts billed but not recognized as revenue</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; margin: 0">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; margin: 0">&#160;</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; margin: 0"><ix:nonFraction id="c151373632" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="trak:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityBilledUnrecognized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">4,391,010</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; margin: 0">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px;"> <p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Revenue recognized related to the opening balance of deferred revenue</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 1px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">(<ix:nonFraction id="c151373633" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">3,057,103</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 1px; margin: 0px;">)</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><b>Balance &#8211; June 30, 2026</b></p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 3px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c151373634" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">4,509,815</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 3px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:continuation>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Our contract assets and liabilities are reported in a net position on a contract-by-contract basis at the end of each reporting period. The difference between the opening and closing balances of our contract assets and deferred revenue primarily results from the timing difference between our performance obligations and the customer&#8217;s payment. We receive payments from customers based on the terms established in our contracts, which <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>vary generally by contract type.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt;"></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: -9pt;"><b></b></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:FinanceLoansAndLeasesReceivablePolicy" id="c151374835" escape="true"><p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: -9pt;"><b>Notes Receivable</b></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: -9pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>SPAR Note Receivable</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> March 17, 2026, </em>PC Group, Inc. ("<i>Lender</i>")&#160;a subsidiary of the Company, entered into an Amended and Restated Senior Unsecured Promissory Note (the "<i>Note</i>") with SPAR Marketing Force, Inc. (the "<i>Borrower</i>"), a subsidiary of SPAR Group, Inc. (&#8220;<i>SPAR</i>&#8221;). The financing arrangement provides for advances of up to $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374221" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million. At <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026, </em>the Company had advanced $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374222" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">3.0</ix:nonFraction> million. The remaining $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374223" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentDelayedDrawCapacity" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million was available for delayed draw beginning <em style="font: inherit;"> July 17, 2026, </em>subject to terms of the agreement.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 7pt; text-indent: 27pt;">The note bears contractual interest at <ix:nonFraction id="c151374224" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">8.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable monthly, and matures on <em style="font: inherit;"> <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-03-17_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" id="c151374563" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en">March 16, 2029</ix:nonNumeric>. </em>The agreement provides for a default interest rate of <ix:nonFraction id="c151374225" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Pure" name="trak:DebtInstrumentDefaultRate" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">12</ix:nonFraction>% per annum. The note is unsecured.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Equity Consideration and Price Protection</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">In connection with the financing, the Borrower agreed to cause SPAR to issue <ix:nonFraction id="c151374226" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Share" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssued" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock to the Company within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-03-17_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationPeriodOfIssuance" id="c151374227" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric> days of execution of the note. The agreement specifies a value of $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374228" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share. These shares were issued in <em style="font: inherit;"> April 2026.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -9pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The arrangement also provides for contingent cash payments if the shares are issued below $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374229" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share or SPAR&#8217;s common stock trades below $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374230" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share at specified measurement dates. Aggregate payments under these provisions are limited to $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374231" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentMaximumAggregatePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">800,000</ix:nonFraction>.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Accounting for Equity Consideration</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The Company expects that the equity consideration will be accounted for as an additional component of the overall return on the loan receivable. The Company will evaluate whether the equity represents a discount or other yield enhancement in accordance with ASC <em style="font: inherit;">835</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">30</em> and ASC <em style="font: inherit;">310</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">20</em><i>,</i> and will recognize such amount over the term of the Note using the effective interest method.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Embedded Feature Evaluation</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The Company has evaluated the price protection provisions and preliminarily concluded that such features are <i><em style="font: inherit;">not</em></i> clearly and closely related to the host loan receivable and therefore <em style="font: inherit;"> may</em><i> </i>require bifurcation as a derivative instrument under ASC <em style="font: inherit;">815</em><i>.</i> This conclusion is based on the fact that the provisions introduce variability in cash flows based on the equity pricing of SPAR Group, Inc., a <i><em style="font: inherit;">third</em></i>-party issuer, which is <i><em style="font: inherit;">not</em></i> clearly and closely related to a lending arrangement. The final determination is pending completion of the Company&#8217;s valuation analysis, which is dependent in part on the issuance and measurement of the related equity consideration.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Credit Risk and Consideration</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The loan is unsecured and represents a concentration of credit risk with a single borrower. The Company&#8217;s ability to collect principal, interest, and any contingent consideration is dependent on the financial condition and operating performance of the Borrower. The Company monitors the Borrower&#8217;s financial condition on an ongoing basis; however, <i><em style="font: inherit;">no</em></i> collateral or other credit enhancements have been obtained to mitigate this risk.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Carrying Amount and Interest Income</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The&#160;<span style="text-decoration: underline; ">n</span>ote receivable is measured at amortized cost. The discount is accreted into interest income over the term of the note using the effective-interest method.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt; text-align: justify;">The carrying amount at <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>was as follows:</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableTextBlock" id="c3275977" escape="true">
    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="finTable" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr class="finHeading" style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;">Amount</p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255);"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 85%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Principal outstanding</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction id="c151373635" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NotesAndLoansReceivableGrossNoncurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Less: unamortized discount</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">(<ix:nonFraction id="c151373636" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableUnamortizedPurchasePremiumDiscount" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF" sign="-">722,222</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">)</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255);"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Note Receivable, net</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 12%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c151373637" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NotesAndLoansReceivableNetNoncurrent" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">2,277,778</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 35pt;">During the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026, </em>the Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374241" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDeferredLoanOriginationFeesNet" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">77,778</ix:nonFraction> of discount accretion and $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374242" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:InvestmentIncomeNet" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">70,323</ix:nonFraction> of contractual interest income related to the note. Accrued interest receivable was $<ix:nonFraction id="c151374243" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis-NotesReceivableMember_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivablesByLegalEntityOfCounterpartyTypeAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:InterestReceivable" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">20,569</ix:nonFraction> at <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and was included in accounts receivable in the consolidated balance sheet.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"></p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b></b></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" name="trak:DisaggregationOfRevenuePolicyTextBlock" id="c151374836" escape="true"><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Disaggregation of Revenue</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">The table below presents disaggregated revenue from contracts with customers by contract-type. All revenues for the years ending <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em> were generated from sales in North America. We believe this disaggregation best depicts the nature, amount, timing and uncertainty of our revenue and cash flows that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be affected by industry, market and other economic factors:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:DisaggregationOfRevenueTableTextBlock" id="c3275978" escape="true">
