     </div>
    </div>
   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Officers, Key Employees, Consultants and Directors Stock Compensation</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">In <em style="font: inherit;"> January 2013, </em>the Board of Directors approved the Second Amended and Restated <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Stock Plan (the &#8220;<i>Amended <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan</i>&#8221;), which Amended <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan was approved by shareholders on <em style="font: inherit;"> March 29, 2013. </em>Under the terms of the Amended <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan, all employees, consultants and directors of the Company are eligible to participate. The maximum aggregate number of shares of Common Stock that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be granted under the Amended <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan is <ix:nonFraction id="c151374371" contextRef="i_2013-01-01_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Amended2011PlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">675,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. The Company&#8217;s Amended <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan terminated on <em style="font: inherit;"> April 1, 2023, </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">no</em> new awards were granted under the <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan thereafter. Awards outstanding under the <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan remain subject to the <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan. Any shares subject to outstanding awards under the <em style="font: inherit;">2011</em> Plan that subsequently expire, terminate, or are surrendered or forfeited for any reason without issuance of shares will automatically become available for issuance under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan, as defined below.</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">In <em style="font: inherit;"> August 2023, </em>our Board of Directors approved the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Omnibus Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;<i><em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan</i>&#8221;), which plan was approved by shareholders on <em style="font: inherit;"> November 20, 2023. </em>Under the terms of the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan, all employees, consultants and directors of the Company are eligible to participate. The maximum aggregate number of shares of Common Stock that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be granted under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan is <ix:nonFraction id="c151374383" contextRef="i_2023-08-01_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">400,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. A Committee of independent members of the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors administers the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">In <em style="font: inherit;"> August 2023, </em>our Board of Directors approved the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Employee Stock Purchase Plan (the &#8220;<i><em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> ESPP</i>&#8221;), which plan was approved by shareholders on <em style="font: inherit;"> November 20, 2023. </em>Under the terms of the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> ESPP, all full- and part-time employees of the Company are eligible to participate. The maximum aggregate number of shares of Common Stock that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>be granted under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> ESPP is <ix:nonFraction id="c151374389" contextRef="i_2023-08-01_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-The2023EsppMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">50,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. A Committee of independent members of the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors administers the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> ESPP.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">The Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="c151374391" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member_TitleOfIndividualAxis-DirectorMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">14,632</ix:nonFraction><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;and <ix:nonFraction id="c151374392" contextRef="d_2024-07-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member_TitleOfIndividualAxis-DirectorMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">11,126</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares to its directors during the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively, under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan. The Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="c151374395" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member_TitleOfIndividualAxis-EmployeesAndConsultantsMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">18,535</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction id="c151374396" contextRef="d_2024-07-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member_TitleOfIndividualAxis-EmployeesAndConsultantsMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">27,295</ix:nonFraction> shares to employees and consultants during the years ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively, under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">The Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="c151374399" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-The2023EsppMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">6,809</ix:nonFraction><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;and <ix:nonFraction id="c151374400" contextRef="d_2024-07-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-StockCompensationPlanMember_PlanNameAxis-The2023EsppMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">10,260</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares to its employees during the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively, under its <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> ESPP.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">The Company holds <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c151374403">no</span> treasury stock.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">Vested and issued shares under the <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em> Plan for the fiscal year ending&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em> and <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2025</em> totaling <ix:nonFraction id="c151374405" contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="trak:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardNonoptionEquityInstrumentsVestedAndIssued" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">18,535</ix:nonFraction><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;and <ix:nonFraction id="c151374406" contextRef="d_2024-07-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_PlanNameAxis-Plan2023Member" unitRef="Share" name="trak:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardNonoptionEquityInstrumentsVestedAndIssued" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">32,245</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, are included in the roll-forward of restricted stock units below.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Restricted Stock Units</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfSharebasedCompensationRestrictedStockAndRestrictedStockUnitsActivityTableTextBlock" id="c3276002" escape="true">
